WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
Hey guys! How's it goin'?  It's Justine. Welcome back to my kitchen.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.120
Today, you don't have to watch me bake a cake.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.520
Because, how many times have i baked cakes on my channel?

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.540
A LOT!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.740
You know the process.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.440
Today we are making a Pac-Man themed cake.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.320
E3 is coming up so I wanted to do something really fun

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.840
and video game inspired and I thought:

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.920
"Uh, a Pac-Man cake? That sounds really really easy."

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.720
So to start, I've got these little tiny cupcakes

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.780
that I'm also gonna ice to go around

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.860
so it's kind of like the little balls that Pac Man eats during the game

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.180
We're also going to make some cherries.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.000
I've got some icing that I'm gonna dye yellow.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.520
So I guess to get started I'm just gonna cut out his little mouth.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:40.620
[Happy Music]

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.180
I think that looks perfect, actually.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.180
Now I need him to go the other way.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:48.800
Oops, hehe, he's gonna eat over here, hehe

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.560
So now I've go to dye our icing yellow.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.380
I prepped everything but the icing I forgot.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.980
That's a lot of dye.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.400
Let's ice up our little Pac Man.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.500
Oh, maybe it should have been a little more yellow.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.500
Mmm, it's vintage.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.100
He's been aging, he's aged very well, leave him alone.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:16.320
Oops, hehe, he's been left out in the sun a little too long, hmmm sorry buddy.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:31.400
[Happy Music]

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.960
I think I'm happy with what we've got going on so far,

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.840
I'm gonna clean up around the edges,

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.320
I'm gonna put his eye on,

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.840
and then we're gonna just, keep going.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:47.200
[Happy Music]

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.200
Where's the torch at?

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.480
You're using a torch?

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:53.200
Yes, 'cause I kinda want to melt it a little bit.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:58.100
Oh, there we go, oh that's quite, that's, that's melting now.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.800
Okay, welp, that's exactly what I wanted to do.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.880
So he had a nice, greasy eye.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.600
Look at that.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:11.780
[Music]

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.040
Pac Man is lookin goood.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:17.400
Now we're gonna ice up some of these little guys, for his little balls.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:29.540
[Music]

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.540
Now I gotta make my cherry.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:37.420
[Music]

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.100
Oh yeah.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.920
One last one and then we are good to goooo.

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.380
Look at him!

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:46.620
I think it turned out so good!

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:47.760
Jen, come look!

00:02:47.760 --> 00:03:08.820
[Happy Music]

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:11.020
*Gasp* Oh God

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:13.020
Oh nooooo, hehe

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:31.100
[Happy Music]

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.100
Oh! It turned out nice!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:33.680
Thank you!

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.540
Are these supposed to be yellow?

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.880
[Pac Man Noises]

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:37.880
It's been a looong time.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.500
They, they might be white, they potentially could be white.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.380
But can't he eat other things?

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:41.620
That's why I've got cherries.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.620
Ooohhh!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.400
The balls might be white in the game, now that I think about it.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.520
[Pac Man Noises]

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.340
But aren't there different color balls?

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.520
There's like, the little ghosts that he eats,

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.940
[Pac Man Noises]

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:53.960
There's a lot of things.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.480
It looks really good, I'm proud of you.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.360
Hey now, hey now, do you want to taste it?

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.080
No

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.640
We've eaten so many cakes today.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:02.220
No, normally I'd say yeah, but, it looks good.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.220
I'm gonna save it, I'm actually gonna put it in the freezer and save it.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.220
Well, thank you guys so much for watching, and thank you Jennifer uh,

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.220
Approving of my beautiful artwork.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.700
Very nice.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.520
Happy E3, and I'll see you guys there.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.960
Bye!!

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:32.380
[Music]

